# The docs site is a NESTED pnpm workspace, but it is formatted by the root
# prettier in the same pass (ADR 0046): prettier-plugin-astro handles the
# components. Only the page sources stay out: prettier's MDX formatter
# inserts a blank line after an opening `(` inside a JSX expression, which
# terminates the expression and breaks the Astro build with a bare
# `Parse error @:1:1` (verified with prettier 3.9.9 on astro 7.3.5).
# (moved from docs-site/.prettierignore, which no longer exists). The **/
# prefix is load-bearing: a custom --ignore-path anchors slash patterns at
# config/, so a bare `docs-site/...` pattern would silently match nothing.
**/docs-site/**/*.mdx
**/docs-site/dist/
**/docs-site/.astro/
